  "description": "All work detailed below has been suggested by and will be done by a certified Tree Surgeon.  All trees other than the Ash are located within our garden.\r\n\r\nT1 Eucalyptus:  Re-pollard, cut to previous points April 2023.  The growth since the last cut has been excessive and one large branch (6m long) fell off in the high winds in Oct 25.\r\n\r\nT2 Norway Spruce:  Re pollard, cut to previous points and trim lower branches, one is 4m long on a tree 11m high, to provide balance and shape\r\n\r\nT3 Lawson Cypress:  Re-pollard, cut to previous points and shape lower branches to provide room for both trees (T2 and T3)\r\n\r\nT4 Cherry:  Approx 8m high.   Prune by 30% to manage height\r\n\r\nT5  Ash:    Approx 17m high located in neighbouring property (21 Waldegrave Gardens).  Cut lower branch which completely overhangs our garden.  Aim to improve light to lawn and shrubs.  Branch to be removed and cut off point is shown in exhibit 5.  This has been discussed and agreed with the owner of 21 Waldegrave Gardens.\r\n\r\nT6 Maple:    Approx 8m high.  Prune by 30% to manage height.",
